My First Project: A WhatsApp-integrated booking system that automatically sends out confirmations and reminders 24 hours before using a script that checks the DB every day to see what reminders need to be sent out.

Has full WhatsApp integration, but due to Twilio's free plan, only whitelisted users will receive WhatsApp messages.

Visit https://whatsapp-booking-osmf.onrender.com to see the deployed site.



